### Layer 5: App Assembly

#### [NEW] [app.js](file:///d:/citius/Visentra/platform/apps/api/src/app.js)
Creates the Express app, registers all middleware, then mounts all routers using `app.use()`. Exports the configured `app`.

#### [MODIFY] [index.js](file:///d:/citius/Visentra/platform/apps/api/src/index.js)
Becomes a ~30 line thin entry point. Imports `app`, runs the boot sequence (Postgres wait loop, `migrate()`, `initNeo4jConstraints()`), then calls `app.listen()`.

